WEBVTT

00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:06.840
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tampaknya manusia akan segera dihancurkan
oleh siluman.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:15.181
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tapi ada penyihir yang berjuang sendirian
dan menyelamatkan semua orang.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:27.277
<c.bg_transparent><i>Dia disebut sebagai Kaisar Sihir
dan menjadi legenda.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.658
<c.bg_transparent>Begini...</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:37.120
<c.bg_transparent>bahkan orang biasa pun bisa menang.</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:40.749
<c.bg_transparent>Bisakah kau lihat betapa kuatnya kami?</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:44.169
<c.bg_transparent>Asta!</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.797
<c.bg_transparent>Pria konyol.</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:53.803
<c.bg_transparent>Jadi, akhirnya kau sadar, Berengsek?</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:57.015
<c.bg_transparent>Apa sihirku sudah disegel?</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:00.852
<c.bg_transparent>Saat kita kembali ke Kesatria Sihir,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>aku ingin kau katakan segalanya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:04.814
<c.bg_transparent>Siapa kau dan apa motifmu?</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.024
<c.bg_transparent>Aku menolak.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.610
<c.bg_transparent>Sepertinya akhirnya sudah tiba.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:13.907
<c.bg_transparent>Sihir Es, Pemakaman Es.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:22.791
<c.bg_transparent>Dari mana asal tekadnya?</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:26.377
<c.bg_transparent>Dasar berengsek!</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:28.546
<c.bg_transparent>Hidup...</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:29.297 --> 00:01:31.883
<c.bg_transparent>Untuk apa dia mencabut hidup seseorang?</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.023
<c.bg_transparent>Habislah kalian.</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:14.861
<c.bg_transparent><i>Kenapa dia tampak sangat senang?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:03:14.986 --> 00:03:16.863
<c.bg_transparent><i>Seseorang baru saja meninggal.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.033
<c.bg_transparent>Kapten, ini bukan saatnya tertawa.</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:22.118
<c.bg_transparent>Meskipun kita kesal,</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:24.329
<c.bg_transparent>Pak Seihi tidak akan kembali hidup-hidup.</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:25.246
<c.bg_transparent>Benar, bukan?</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:27.665
<c.bg_transparent>Ya, Yami benar!</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:28.291 --> 00:03:31.294
<c.bg_transparent>Pak Seihi selalu menyukai lingkungan</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>yang ceria.</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:31.419 --> 00:03:33.796
<c.bg_transparent>Ayo! Tertawa!</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:36.299 --> 00:03:37.383
<c.bg_transparent>Tertawa!</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:39.135 --> 00:03:40.762
<c.bg_transparent>Lebih keras!</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.182
