00:03:52.106 --> 00:03:53.441
<c.bg_transparent>Ini bagus.</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.445
<c.bg_transparent>Kejadian yang menimpa Pak Seihi</c.bg_transparent>
