00:04:02.283 --> 00:04:03.701
<c.bg_transparent>Kalian harus bangga.</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:06.663 --> 00:04:10.416
<c.bg_transparent>Kalian semua bekerja dengan baik,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>dan aku berterima kasih, Bodoh.</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.210
<c.bg_transparent>- Ya!</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Ya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:12.543 --> 00:04:13.795
<c.bg_transparent>Terima kasih.</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:17.048 --> 00:04:18.466
<c.bg_transparent>Ada apa dengan isyarat itu?</c.bg_transparent>

