00:05:12.228 --> 00:05:13.479
<c.bg_transparent>Hei, kau!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:13.896 --> 00:05:18.359
<c.bg_transparent>Jangan merusak apa pun!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:19.235 --> 00:05:20.445
<c.bg_transparent>Maafkan aku.</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:21.946 --> 00:05:25.491
<c.bg_transparent>Tapi jam saku itu</c.bg_transparent>
