<c.bg_transparent>Astaga. Dari mana dia datang?</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>Manis sekali!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:41.257 --> 00:05:42.842
<c.bg_transparent>Bagaimana bisa itu manis?</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:42.967 --> 00:05:44.594
