<c.bg_transparent>- Maaf!</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:13.081
<c.bg_transparent><i>Sudah jelas kau yang paling merusak!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:06:13.289 --> 00:06:15.875
<c.bg_transparent>Baiklah. Boleh minta perhatiannya?</c.bg_transparent>

