00:17:57.951 --> 00:18:01.163
<c.bg_transparent>Masih terlalu dini bagimu</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>untuk pergi ke sana.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:01.538 --> 00:18:05.000
<c.bg_transparent>Jika amatir tidak berhati-hati di sana,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>mereka bisa kena masalah.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:06.168 --> 00:18:07.336
<c.bg_transparent>Baiklah!</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:07.544 --> 00:18:09.630
<c.bg_transparent>Aku datang!</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:09.713 --> 00:18:12.508
<c.bg_transparent>Aku akan memakai gajiku</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>dan meningkatkannya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:12.633 --> 00:18:14.760
<c.bg_transparent><i>Aku bertemu kenalanku!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:18:17.262 --> 00:18:19.890
<c.bg_transparent>Sial! Aku kalah lagi!</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:22.267 --> 00:18:25.521
<c.bg_transparent>Itu karena aku bisa melihat masa depan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:26.855 --> 00:18:29.066
<c.bg_transparent>Wanita tua itu sangat hebat.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:29.858 --> 00:18:33.070
<c.bg_transparent>Lagi pula, bukan saatnya</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>untuk ini sekarang.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:33.529 --> 00:18:34.947
<c.bg_transparent>Aku harus kembali bekerja.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:35.489 --> 00:18:37.449
<c.bg_transparent>Mereka menyebutnya pekerjaan,</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:37.533 --> 00:18:39.952
<c.bg_transparent>tapi ini sebenarnya menangkap pencopet.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:40.244 --> 00:18:43.247
<c.bg_transparent>Apa ini sesuatu</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>yang harus dilakukan Kesatria Sihir?</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:45.791 --> 00:18:48.127
<c.bg_transparent>Tapi kapten sangat menakutkan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.170
<c.bg_transparent>Aku tidak berani tidak mematuhinya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:51.547 --> 00:18:53.298
<c.bg_transparent>Nak, kau keberatan?</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:53.423 --> 00:18:56.135
<c.bg_transparent>Awas. Akan kupotong menjadi dua!</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:58.303 --> 00:19:01.598
<c.bg_transparent>Aku akhirnya berhasil masuk</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>Kesatria Sihir, tapi rasanya menyedihkan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:01.723 --> 00:19:04.476
<c.bg_transparent>Ini Belalang Hijau.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:05.102 --> 00:19:06.645
<c.bg_transparent>Ini belalang sentadu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.522
<c.bg_transparent>Serangga.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:08.897 --> 00:19:11.441
<c.bg_transparent>Aku harus bekerja keras setiap hari.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:11.692 --> 00:19:14.903
<c.bg_transparent>Bahkan jika pergi misi, aku harus</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>mempertaruhkan hidupku sebagai umpan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:15.362 --> 00:19:17.906
<c.bg_transparent>Aku mengalami sembelit</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>dan akan botak karena itu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:18.782 --> 00:19:20.200
<c.bg_transparent>Sial.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:22.828 --> 00:19:24.037
<c.bg_transparent>Dia manis sekali!</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:24.538 --> 00:19:26.290
<c.bg_transparent>Bagaimana dengan ini?</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:26.415 --> 00:19:29.668
<c.bg_transparent>Sepertinya itu bisa digunakan</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>untuk menstabilkan kekuatan sihirmu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:30.586 --> 00:19:31.879
<c.bg_transparent>Kelihatannya mengerikan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:34.631
<c.bg_transparent>Jangan bilang begitu. Cobalah dahulu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:48.228 --> 00:19:51.190
<c.bg_transparent>Ini salahmu karena berdiri di sana!</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:52.524 --> 00:19:54.818
<c.bg_transparent>Aku tidak menduga akan bertemu</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>denganmu di sini!</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:54.943 --> 00:19:56.278
<c.bg_transparent>Ada apa?</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:57.112 --> 00:20:01.909
<c.bg_transparent>Pasar Gelap bukan tempat</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>untuk gadis cantik sepertimu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:03.118 --> 00:20:04.578
<c.bg_transparent>Kau tersesat?</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:04.953 --> 00:20:09.958
<c.bg_transparent>Izinkan aku, anggota elite Kesatria Sihir,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>untuk mengantarmu keluar.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:10.125 --> 00:20:12.002
<c.bg_transparent>Enyahlah, serangga terbang.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:14.546 --> 00:20:18.884
<c.bg_transparent>Hei! Aku menemukan benda menarik!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:19.051 --> 00:20:21.762
<c.bg_transparent>Jangan bilang kau beli itu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:21.887 --> 00:20:23.222
<c.bg_transparent>Dia bisa bicara!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:23.347 --> 00:20:24.306
<c.bg_transparent>Dia membelinya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:24.431 --> 00:20:25.265
<c.bg_transparent>Lihat!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:25.349 --> 00:20:26.934
<c.bg_transparent><i>Kita manusia!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:20:27.059 --> 00:20:28.310
<c.bg_transparent>Benar, bukan?</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:28.852 --> 00:20:30.604
<c.bg_transparent>Lalu kenapa?</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:32.439 --> 00:20:34.316
<c.bg_transparent><i>Anak nakal ini...</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:20:34.816 --> 00:20:37.236
<c.bg_transparent>Tunggu. Bukankah kau Haha?</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:37.361 --> 00:20:38.987
<c.bg_transparent>Aku Sekke! Bukan Haha!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:39.112 --> 00:20:40.948
<c.bg_transparent>Haha, bagaimana kabarmu?</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:41.073 --> 00:20:42.574
<c.bg_transparent>Sudah kubilang! Aku Haha...</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:42.658 --> 00:20:44.159
<c.bg_transparent>Tidak, maksudku, Sekke!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:44.868 --> 00:20:45.994
<c.bg_transparent>Siapa dia?</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:46.286 --> 00:20:48.580
<c.bg_transparent>Seseorang yang kutemui di ujian masuk.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:49.164 --> 00:20:51.375
<c.bg_transparent>Begitu rupanya.</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>Dia anggota Belalang Hijau.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:51.667 --> 00:20:55.170
<c.bg_transparent><i>Apa dua wanita cantik ini bersamanya?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:20:55.295 --> 00:20:56.421
<c.bg_transparent><i>Kalau begitu,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:20:56.546 --> 00:20:59.216
<c.bg_transparent><i>mereka berdua pasti anggota Banteng Hitam.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:20:59.466 --> 00:21:00.801
<c.bg_transparent><i>Asta, dasar berengsek.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:21:00.884 --> 00:21:03.720
<c.bg_transparent><i>Meski berada di Banteng Hitam,
kau membuatku iri.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:21:04.304 --> 00:21:05.514
<c.bg_transparent><i>Kalau dipikir-pikir,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:21:05.639 --> 00:21:10.310
<c.bg_transparent><i>semua salahmu aku berakhir
di Belalang Hijau.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:21:12.437 --> 00:21:14.273
<c.bg_transparent><i>Menyebalkan sekali.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:21:23.782 --> 00:21:25.867
<c.bg_transparent>Pencuri!</c.bg_transparent>

00:21:25.993 --> 00:21:28.245
<c.bg_transparent>Hadiah kemenanganku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:21:28.495 --> 00:21:30.747
<c.bg_transparent>Berhenti di sana!</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:05.634 --> 00:23:08.095
<c.bg_transparent><i>- Semanggi Mungil!
- Semanggi Mungil!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:09.554 --> 00:23:12.057
<c.bg_transparent><i>Kelas Haha dari Sekke!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:13.058 --> 00:23:14.059
<c.bg_transparent>"Haha!"</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:14.351 --> 00:23:16.311
<c.bg_transparent>- "Haha!"</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Tidak, itu tidak benar.</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:16.436 --> 00:23:17.562
<c.bg_transparent>"Haha!"</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:17.938 --> 00:23:19.231
<c.bg_transparent>"Haha!"</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:19.481 --> 00:23:23.193
<c.bg_transparent>Kau masih jauh dari "Haha".</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:23.318 --> 00:23:24.486
<c.bg_transparent>"Haha!"</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:24.611 --> 00:23:25.862
<c.bg_transparent>Apa itu "Haha"?</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:30.033 --> 00:23:31.785
<c.bg_transparent><i>Ini kesempatan untuk melakukan kebaikan!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:35.747
<c.bg_transparent><i>Aku ingin menangkap pencopet
dan mendapat bintang dari Kaisar Sihir.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:36.081 --> 00:23:38.041
<c.bg_transparent>Black Clover, </c.bg_transparent><c.bg_transparent><i>Halaman 12,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:38.166 --> 00:23:40.001
<c.bg_transparent><i>"Kaisar Sihir Melihat."</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:40.127 --> 00:23:41.920
<c.bg_transparent><i>"Haha"-ku adalah tak pernah menyerah!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:42.003 --> 00:23:43.296
<c.bg_transparent>Terjemahan subtitle oleh Harith Jobs</c.bg_transparent>
